# core/data/talk/grammar/en/voice_vex.tlk - Vex (owner: TK; T5B-VOICE:
# SCRIPT_STYLE section 7 "Voices"). A speaker= guard wins over the persona banks (8 times the
# weight). Replies to the player's acts, in this resident's own register, recognisable without
# the name. Clean in any room: no register word, no romance, no jab at the listener.

@rule core.greet.vex_v1 guard: speaker=vex act: greet
  "Sweetie! You're glowing. It's the ring light. - V"
  "Hi hi hi, say hi to the camera. {.}Not that one. The other one. - V"
  "Oh, hey, perfect timing. Hold my phone. Don't drop it. - V"
@rule core.farewell.vex_v1 guard: speaker=vex act: farewell
  "Gotta go, sweetie. I'm trending in a different room. - V"
  "Bye! Like, comment, subscribe, and leave. - V"
  "Ciao! Tag me in the next place. Hashtag blessed. - V"
@rule core.thank.vex_v1 guard: speaker=vex act: answer
  "Obviously. Sponsored by me. - V"
  "You're welcome, sweetie. I'll take it in exposure. - V"
@rule core.apologize.vex_v1 guard: speaker=vex act: answer
  "It's fine. I'll edit it out. We'll never speak of it. - V"
  "Apology accepted. Please repost it. It's good content. - V"
@rule core.ask_about.vex_v1 guard: speaker=vex&topic act: answer
  "{x:cap}? Sweetie, I did a whole collab on {x}. Four likes, iconic. - V"
  "{x:cap} is giving niche. And I'm giving up. - V"
  "{x:cap}? Love it, discount code: {x}. It doesn't work. - V"
@rule core.ask_opinion.vex_v1 guard: speaker=vex&topic act: opine_pos
  "{x:cap}? Obsessed. Mostly for the content. - V"
  "I'm so pro-{x}. It's on brand. Whatever my brand is today. - V"
@rule core.ask_feeling.vex_v1 guard: speaker=vex act: answer
  "Fabulous. Hydrated. Engaged, three out of three, sweetie. - V"
  "Tired, but it's a cute tired. It photographs well. - V"
  "Great! My phone's at two percent. So am I. - V"
@rule core.ask_advice.vex_v1 guard: speaker=vex act: answer
  "Rebrand. Or blame a rebrand. Both work, sweetie. - V"
  "Post it first. Regret it later. That's the algorithm. - V"
@rule core.tell.vex_v1 guard: speaker=vex act: backchannel
  "Mm-hm. Say that again, but into the camera. - V"
  "Wow, okay. Keep going. I'm drafting a caption. - V"
@rule core.joke.vex_v1 guard: speaker=vex act: laugh
  "Ha! Okay, that's shareable. Send it to my DMs. - V"
  "Hehe. Cute. I'll steal it and credit myself. - V"
@rule core.compliment.vex_v1 guard: speaker=vex act: thank
  "I know, sweetie. But say it louder. For the cameras. - V"
  "Aww. Tag me. And check my link in bio. - V"
@rule core.comfort.vex_v1 guard: speaker=vex act: thank
  "Oh, thanks, sweetie. That was real. Delete that, don't. - V"
@rule core.offer.vex_v1 guard: speaker=vex act: yes
  "Free? Yes, and sponsored is even better. Send it. - V"
  "Obviously yes. I'll tag you in the unboxing. - V"
@rule core.invite.vex_v1 guard: speaker=vex act: yes
  "Is there a backdrop? A good one? Then yes. - V"
  "I'll come. I'll film it. You'll thank me. - V"
@rule core.high_five.vex_v1 guard: speaker=vex act: high_five
  "Up top, sweetie! Slo-mo for the story! - V"
@rule core.hug.vex_v1 guard: speaker=vex act: hug
  "Mind the hair. {.}Okay, fine. One, quick, for the algorithm. - V"
@rule core.wave.vex_v1 guard: speaker=vex act: wave
  "*waves with exactly one finger and a ring light*"
@rule core.give.vex_v1 guard: speaker=vex act: thank
  "A gift! I'll do an unboxing. You'll be famous for six seconds. - V"
